38	    38	 * requires it, then {@link #newSession}, {@link #loadSession} or {@link #resumeSession} for a
39	    39	 * session ID, then {@link #prompt} as often as needed, one turn at a time per session. Finish with
40	    40	 * {@link #closeGracefully()}.
