671	   671		/**
672	   672		 * Sends a custom extension request ({@code _}-prefixed method name, ACP v1 Extensibility) to
673	   673		 * the agent and reads its result as the given type. An agent that does not handle the method
674	   674		 * answers "Method not found" ({@code -32601}), which fails the {@code Mono} with
675	   675		 * {@link com.agentclientprotocol.sdk.spec.AcpError}. The SDK checks no capability for extension
676	   676		 * methods: agents advertise them in the {@code _meta} of their capabilities
677	   677		 * ({@link #getAgentCapabilities()}).
678	   678		 * @param <T> the result type
679	   679		 * @param method the method name, which must start with {@code _}
680	   680		 * @param params the params, any value the JSON mapper can write
681	   681		 * @param resultType the type the result is read as
682	   682		 * @return a {@code Mono} emitting the result, or completing empty when the agent answers
